		{
			dependencies: [
				"7B00000000000010"
				"7B0000000000000E"
				"7B0000000000000A"
			]
			description: [
				"&9&lYou have run the whole Powah ladder.&r"
				""
				"Solid fuel, lava, sunlight, and finally a reactor. Cells to buffer it, cables to move it, and Ender Cells to throw it across the solar system without a single wire."
				""
				"&7Powah is deliberately the &lsimple&r power mod in this pack - no gas plumbing, no heat management, no meltdowns. It scales by tier rather than by complexity, which makes it the right thing to lean on while you build the harder systems in Mekanism.&r"
				""
				"&8If your base browns out, it is almost always cable tier or missing buffer - not generation."
			]
